

   =====( RoboChat V0.76 )============================================


           Trion RoboChat CliDoor.

           (c) Copyright Paul Spijkerman, '96-'97. All rights reserved.

           Written for use with the Trion BBS package.


   ===================================================================


        This is a very simple Chat robot .. it simulates the
        normal page sysop menu command .. so it looks to the
        user if he is paging the sysop .. but after that he is
        chatting with a programm.

        Note that if you replace the page menu command with
        this door you can loose friends very quick ;)

        The whole chat is written to a log file in the log
        directory so you can read all conversations.
        Above the chat is a header with the full name of
        the chatter.

        Note that there is a Dutch version and an English
        version of the door.

        When I first installed the door it did a fine job as
        a cybersysop .. users tought they chatted with me
        and typed there questions or problems with they
        probably didn't do when they had to write a comment
        to sysop. Also it told them to write their full problem
        in a comment to sysop .. and users didn't seem to have
        a problem with it .. until they find out it is a
        chat robot.


        So in the near future I will probably upgrade this
        door to a multilingual fully functioning Cybersysop :)


        Add something like this to the menu to use the door:
        Dutch version:


Cmd "R" , 0-255
   CliDoor  "doors:chatdoor/RoboChat ~50 "
EndCmd


        English version:


Cmd "R" , 0-255
   CliDoor  "doors:chatdoor/RoboChat_Eng ~50 "
EndCmd

